SHENRON is an **adaptive red-team research framework** focused on **controlled, authorized testing** and **defensive simulation** in lab environments.

> ⚠️ **Ethics & Legal**
> Research & education only. Use *only* on systems you own or have explicit written permission to test.

## Highlights (Research Goals)
- Modular orchestrator with pluggable components.
- Emphasis on telemetry/observability and reproducible lab runs.
- Mutation sandbox for *benign* fixtures and decoy/evasion research.
- Strict separation between orchestration core and env-specific modules.
